# =============================================================================
# services/qmldir — the shell's shared, single-instance state
# =============================================================================
# Same rule as theme/qmldir: QML will not treat a file as a singleton on the
# strength of the `pragma Singleton` line inside it alone. It also has to be
# named here, in this exact shape:
#
#     singleton <TypeName> <version> <FileName>
#
# Miss it and the shell fails at start-up with "FocusState is not a type",
# which is a confusing way to be told "you did not write it down here".
#
# This directory is pulled in by `import "../../services"` from the components.
# =============================================================================

singleton FocusState 1.0 FocusState.qml
singleton SystemAppearance 1.0 SystemAppearance.qml
